			<div class="hero__content">
				<p class="hero__greeting reveal" data-delay="0">// software engineer</p>
				<h1 class="hero__name reveal" data-delay="1">Ali Can<br/>Keskin<span class="hero__cursor">_</span></h1>
				<p class="hero__title reveal" data-delay="2">XR &amp; Systems Engineer</p>
				<p class="hero__subtitle reveal" data-delay="3">XR Development &bull; C++ Systems &bull; Real-Time Streaming</p>
				<div class="hero__cta reveal" data-delay="4">
					<a href="#projects" class="btn btn--primary">View Projects</a>
					<a href="https://github.com/AcKeskin/AcKeskin.github.io/blob/main/docs/CV.pdf" class="btn btn--outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i> Resume</a>
